  m_Name: VerseThree_DialogueData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Messages:
  - The familiar voice awakens from within the statue. It's much clearer now...
  - 'The final verse speaks of the core belief of your people''s faith of the Moon.
    Her Grace''s light isn''t just like fire that merely brightens the night sky.
    Divinity can never be extinguished, forever above humanity. '
  - What was declared about the Moon to truly be to the people?
  ButtonOneText: Thou art the ever bright constancy we gaze upon to never forget.
  ButtonTwoText: Thou art the constancy that shapes our world in thine own image.
  ButtonThreeText: Thou art the silent maiden that witnesses the trivialities of
    humanity.
  correctButtonNumber: 1
